 reconciled bank account balances.</li><li>Levy income is based on outstanding levy notices with due dates in each forecast month. Overdue levies are assumed collected in the current month.</li><li>Supplier costs are based on approved or outstanding invoices with due dates in each forecast month.</li><li>Months without specific levy or invoice data use a proportional estimate from the current financial year budget.</li><li>This forecast does not account for unplanned capital works, insurance claims, or other ad hoc income and expenditure.</li></ul></div></div>"`;

